<h2 id="solana" class="group/heading flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-1"><a data-card="" href="#solana">Solana</a><button aria-live="polite" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium duration-100 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-fd-ring hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground p-1 [&amp;_svg]:size-4 not-prose shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover/heading:opacity-100"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Copy Anchor Link</span></button></h2>
<p>Sponsored updates reach the price feed accounts of both the Pyth Core and the Pyth Core Compatible programs. The table lists the Pyth Core accounts. A Pyth Core Compatible account is derived from the feed ID, and the Solana guide&#x27;s <a href="/pro/use-prices-on-blockchain/solana#price-feed-accounts">Price Feed Accounts</a> section shows how.</p>
<div class="my-6"><p class="mb-4 text-body text-fd-foreground">The price feeds listed below are currently sponsored in<!-- --> <strong>Solana mainnet</strong>.</p><div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-700 bg-fd-background"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-5 px-4 py-3"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-docs-ui text-fd-foreground"><span class="size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span><span class="text-body font-medium">Default:</span><span>1 minute heartbeat / 0.5% price deviation</span><span class="text-gray-500">(<!-- -->61<!-- -->)</span></div><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-docs-ui text-fd-foreground"><span class="size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-orange-500"></span><span class="text-body font-medium">Exception:</span><span>30 seconds heartbeat / 0.5% price deviation</span><span class="text-gray-500">(<!-- -->2<!-- -->)</span></div><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-docs-ui text-fd-foreground"><span class="size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-orange-500"></span><span class="text-body font-medium">Exception:</span><span>4 minutes heartbeat / 0.05% price deviation</span><span class="text-gray-500">(<!-- -->1<!-- -->)</span></div></div><div class="not-prose max-h-100 overflow-y-auto rounded-b-xl"><div class="relative overflow-auto"><table class="grid w-full caption-bottom text-sm"><thead class="[&amp;_tr]:border-b grid sticky top-0 z-1" data-slot="table-header"><tr class="border-b transition-colors has-aria-expanded:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted flex w-full bg-background hover:bg-background" data-slot="table-row"><th class="px-2 text-left align-middle text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-muted-foreground uppercase [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 relative flex h-auto min-h-10 items-center whitespace-normal" data-slot="table-head" style="width:200px">Name<div aria-valuenow="200" class="absolute -right-2 top-0 z-1 h-full w-4 cursor-col-resize select-none touch-none group" role="separator" tabindex="-1"><div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-border transition-all group-hover:w-0.5 group-hover:bg-foreground/50"></div></div></th><th class="px-2 text-left align-middle text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-muted-foreground uppercase [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 relative flex h-auto min-h-10 items-center whitespace-normal" data-slot="table-head" style="width:180px">Account Address<div aria-valuenow="180" class="absolute -right-2 top-0 z-1 h-full w-4 cursor-col-resize select-none touch-none group" role="separator" tabindex="-1"><div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-border transition-all group-hover:w-0.5 group-hover:bg-foreground/50"></div></div></th><th class="px-2 text-left align-middle text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-muted-foreground uppercase [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 relative flex h-auto min-h-10 items-center whitespace-normal" data-slot="table-head" style="width:180px">Price Feed Id<div aria-valuenow="180" class="absolute -right-2 top-0 z-1 h-full w-4 cursor-col-resize select-none touch-none group" role="separator" tabindex="-1"><div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-border transition-all group-hover:w-0.5 group-hover:bg-foreground/50"></div></div></th><th class="px-2 text-left align-middle text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-muted-foreground uppercase [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 relative flex h-auto min-h-10 items-center whitespace-normal" data-slot="table-head" style="width:200px">Update Parameters<div aria-valuenow="200" class="absolute -right-2 top-0 z-1 h-full w-4 cursor-col-resize select-none touch-none group" role="separator" tabindex="-1"><div class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-border transition-all group-hover:w-0.5 group-hover:bg-foreground/50"></div></div></th></tr></thead><tbody class="[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0 grid relative" data-slot="table-body" style="height:2560px"></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>
<p>Note: The addresses represent the price feed account for shard 0 of the relevant price feed id.</p>
